efore a deep study\n- **Adaptive l"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"earning materials** - Generates README, summary, insights, Q&A; based on paper complexity\n- **Code d"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"emonstrations** - Clean implementations with Jupyter notebooks and original code integration\n- **Int"},{"id":"p9s7","text":"eractive web viewer** - Nuxt.js interface with math equation support (KaTeX)\n- **Intelligent assessm"},{"id":"p9s8","text":"ent** - Difficulty levels and paper type detection for adaptive content generation"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Quick Start"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### Install all supported agents"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Install Claude Code, Codex, OpenCode, and DeepSeek Harness with one command—no repository clone requ"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ll Claude Code, Codex, OpenCode, and DeepSeek Harness with one command—no repository clone required:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"The default `all` target covers all four agents. For Claude Code, the installer uses the official Cl"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"aude CLI to register the package-local marketplace and install or update the user-scoped plugin. For"},{"id":"p14s3","text":" the other agents, it installs the shared Skills and OpenCode commands where applicable."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Install only selected agents when needed:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Upgrade an existing installation with the same formal distribution channel:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"The default upgrade target is `all`. If the existing installation only targets selected agents, pass"},{"id":"p19s2","text":" the same `--target` list during upgrade so no additional agent integrations are added."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The npm package copies its packaged plugin runtime to the user data directory, installs the generate"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"d compatibility Skills in `~/.agents/skills/` when a shared-Skills host is selected, and adds OpenCo"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"de commands when OpenCode is selected. It initializes `~/claude-papers/` only when the library does "},{"id":"p20s4","text":"not already exist. Restart the selected agents after installation or upgrade."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### Claude Code Marketplace-only alternative"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"If you only use Claude Code, you can still install directly from its marketplace:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Claude Paper currently runs through Agent Skills; no separate MCP server installation or configurati"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"rrently runs through Agent Skills; no separate MCP server installation or configuration is required."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### System Requirements"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- **Node.js**: 20.19.x, or 22.12.0 and higher\n- **npm**: Comes with Node.js\n- **Agent host**: Claude"},{"id":"p26s2","text":" Code, Codex, OpenCode, or DeepSeek Harness\n- **Claude Code CLI**: Required when `all` or `claude-co"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"de` is selected\n- **poppler-utils**: For PDF image extraction (install via system package manager)\n-"},{"id":"p26s4","text":" **macOS**: `brew install poppler`\n- **Ubuntu/Debian**: `sudo apt-get install poppler-utils`\n- **Arc"},{"id":"p26s5","text":"h Linux**: `sudo pacman -S poppler`"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### Quickly Summarize a Research Paper"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Ask the selected agent for a quick summary, or use the host command directly:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"In Codex or DeepSeek Harness, ask for a quick paper summary or explicitly load the `claude-paper-sum"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"mary` Skill. This creates `quick-summary.md` while preserving the PDF, complete `paper.txt`, and met"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"adata in the shared paper library."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"### Study a Research Paper"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Simply ask the selected agent to study a paper:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"You can also use URLs:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"The agent will automatically trigger the study workflow and:\n1. Parse the PDF and extract metadata\n2"},{"id":"p37s2","text":". Analyze paper complexity and type\n3. Generate adaptive learning materials\n4. Create code demonstra"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"tions (if applicable)\n5. Extract and include original code (if available)\n6. Extract key figures and"},{"id":"p37s4","text":" images\n7. Update the global search index\n8. Launch the web viewer automatically"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"### Launch Web Viewer"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"In Codex or DeepSeek Harness, ask the agent to start the Claude Paper web viewer or explicitly load "},{"id":"p40s2","text":"the `claude-paper-webui` Skill."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"Opens the interactive web interface at **http://localhost:5815** where you can:\n- Browse all studied"},{"id":"p41s2","text":" papers\n- View generated materials with math rendering\n- Access code demonstrations and notebooks\n- "},{"id":"p41s3","text":"Search through your paper library"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"## Paper Storage Structure"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"Papers are organized in `~/claude-papers/papers/{paper-slug}/`:"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"### Plugin Structure"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"### Key Components"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"1. **Study Skill** - Main workflow agent that orchestrates deep paper processing\n2. **Summary Skill*"},{"id":"p49s2","text":"* - Concise paper-screening workflow\n3. **PDF Parser** - Extracts text, metadata, and code links usi"},{"id":"p49s3","text":"ng pdf-parse\n4. **Image Extractor** - Python script for PDF figure extraction\n5. **Web Viewer** - Nu"},{"id":"p49s4","text":"xt.js application with Nitro API server\n6. **Hooks System** - Claude Code lifecycle setup\n7. **Agent"},{"id":"p49s5","text":" Adapters** - Generated discovery and invocation wrappers for Codex, OpenCode, and DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p51s1","text":"### Running Tests"},{"id":"p52s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p53s1","text":"### Verifying the npm Distribution"},{"id":"p54s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p55s1","text":"### Building for Production"},{"id":"p56s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p57s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p58s1","text":"### Environment Variables"},{"id":"p59s1","text":"No configuration required! The plugin uses sensible defaults:"},{"id":"p60s1","text":"- **Papers directory**: `~/claude-papers/`\n- **Web viewer port**: `5815`\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

